Suppose that X is open in R'' and f:X ⊆ R'' -> R has continuous first- and second-order partial derivatives. 
Then the order in which we evaluate the mixed second-order partials is immaterial; that is, if i₁ and i₂ are any two integers between 1 and n, then 

		(δ²f)/(δx(sub(i₁)) δx(sub(i₂))) = (δ²f)/(δx(sub(i₂)) δx(sub(i₁))) 
